  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Place assumptions",
   "texto": [
    "**Dans** = inside. **Sur** = over, over. **Sous** = below.",
    "**Devant** = in front of. **Derrière** = behind. **Entre** = enter.",
    "**À côté de** = next to. masculine singular **le**, **de + le** is contracted in **du**: **à côté du canapé**. In front of feminine **la**, **de la**: **à côté de la lampe** is maintained."
   ]
